      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feels like i'm overreacting maybe. i actually just checked my blood pressure at the pharmacy while i was out and it's a little high, like 145/95, but i think that's just cuz i was rushing and stressed from the swelling. if i just stay home, drink lots of water, and maybe take some of my prenatal vitamins extra early, do u think that'll help bring it down? i really just want to sleep it off and see how i feel in the morning.",
